{
  "$comment": "Rules for tools/policy/policy.mjs. Crucible may name other products for integration, compatibility, migration and comparison, but no text may say or imply that Crucible copied, cloned, ported or remade another product or its features. This file and the checker's fixtures are exempt from scanning because they must contain the phrases.",
